  m_Name: ForceItOut
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'the player wants the answer and she wants it NOW. she demands that
    jessi tell her if she really wants any of her help. there''s nothing more helpful
    than learning the life someone has lived thus far.


    jessi refuses, telling
    the player to drop it, but the player continues to egg on. frustrated, jessi
    angrily explains how she was forced into being a social recluse by her shitty
    parents because of her shitty brother that got kidnapped by shitty people and
    god it''s all so fucking shit. there are you fucking happy i said it


    the
    player notices that jessi''s eyes start to water'
